<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav Jan 1997 crude imports down vs Dec 96.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav Jan 1997 crude imports down vs Dec 96.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
